### Fallback kỹ thuật cho U018 - ưu tiên demo happy path bằng UI HANBAY + SePay Test Mode.
### Chạy booking.http request 1-2 trước để có paymentCode/paymentAmount trong global variables.
### Giá trị mặc định dưới đây khớp application-local.yml; nếu dùng env thật phải thay tương ứng.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@webhookApiKey = local-dev-webhook-key
@accountNumber = 0000000000
@gateway = TESTBANK
@eventId = 987654321
@referenceCode = DEMO-U018-987654321

### Dữ liệu riêng cho các scenario - không dùng chung payment đã SUCCESS.
@partialPaymentCode = replace-with-active-pending-payment-code
@partialPaymentAmount = 100000
@overpaymentCode = replace-with-another-active-pending-payment-code
@overpaymentAmount = 2000000
@latePaymentCode = replace-with-expired-cancelled-or-failed-payment-code
@latePaymentAmount = 100000

### 1. Happy path fallback - nhận đủ tiền, booking còn hạn
### Kỳ vọng: 200 ACK; event PROCESSED; payment SUCCESS; booking CONFIRMED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{eventId}},
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:30:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "subAccount": null,
  "code": null,
  "content": "{{paymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": {{paymentAmount}},
  "accumulated": {{paymentAmount}},
  "description": "Thanh toán {{paymentCode}}",
  "referenceCode": "{{referenceCode}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("Webhook hợp lệ được ACK", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected HTTP 200");
        client.assert(response.body.success === true, "Expected success=true");
    });
%}

### 2. Duplicate retry - gửi lại chính xác event/payload request 1
### Kỳ vọng: vẫn 200; không tạo thêm webhook event/transaction; paid amount không tăng lần hai.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{eventId}},
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:30:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "subAccount": null,
  "code": null,
  "content": "{{paymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": {{paymentAmount}},
  "accumulated": {{paymentAmount}},
  "description": "Thanh toán {{paymentCode}}",
  "referenceCode": "{{referenceCode}}"
}

### 3. Partial payment - dùng payment PENDING riêng
### Kỳ vọng: ghi transaction; payment/booking vẫn PENDING cho đến khi tổng nhận đủ.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 987654331,
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:31:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "content": "{{partialPaymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": {{partialPaymentAmount}},
  "accumulated": {{partialPaymentAmount}},
  "description": "Thanh toán một phần {{partialPaymentCode}}",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-PARTIAL-987654331"
}

### 4. Overpayment - amount phải lớn hơn tổng tiền của payment riêng này
### Kỳ vọng: payment SUCCESS; booking CONFIRMED; refund PENDING cho phần thừa.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 987654332,
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:32:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "content": "{{overpaymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": {{overpaymentAmount}},
  "accumulated": {{overpaymentAmount}},
  "description": "Thanh toán thừa {{overpaymentCode}}",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-OVERPAY-987654332"
}

### 5. Late payment/partial late payment - payment đã EXPIRED/CANCELLED/FAILED
### Kỳ vọng: booking không CONFIRMED; ghi đúng tiền nhận; refund PENDING đúng latePaymentAmount.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 987654333,
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:33:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "content": "{{latePaymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": {{latePaymentAmount}},
  "accumulated": {{latePaymentAmount}},
  "description": "Thanh toán đến muộn {{latePaymentCode}}",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-LATE-987654333"
}

### 6. Transfer out - event được IGNORED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 987654334,
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:34:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "content": "{{paymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "out",
  "transferAmount": 100000,
  "accumulated": 0,
  "description": "Giao dịch tiền ra",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-OUT-987654334"
}

