### 12. Payload rỗng - 400 VALIDATION_FAILED/MALFORMED_REQUEST
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Enum transferType sai - 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/sepay/webhook
Authorization: Apikey {{webhookApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 987654340,
  "gateway": "{{gateway}}",
  "transactionDate": "2026-08-17 09:40:00",
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "content": "{{paymentCode}}",
  "transferType": "incoming",
  "transferAmount": 100000,
  "accumulated": 100000,
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-BAD-ENUM-987654340"
}

### 14. Monitoring summary - MANAGER hoặc ADMIN
@monitoringAccessToken = replace-with-manager-or-admin-access-token
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment-monitoring/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{monitoringAccessToken}}

### 15. Tìm webhook theo event ID - MANAGER hoặc ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment-monitoring/webhook-events?page=0&size=10&keyword={{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{monitoringAccessToken}}

### 16. Anonymous monitoring - 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment-monitoring/summary
